From: Ryan Newton <rrnewton@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 20:20:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Document LiteInst plain-fork boundary

Strengthen the coordinator RPC regression to prove a fork child is attributed as a distinct sender. Document the single-threaded process boundary and the lifecycle, timer, and ptrace fallback work that remains.
